 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates an RFC 6902 patch for sending only the changes between two JSON
+documents. It does not mutate either input and uses member and array-entry paths where possible.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+createPatch({ user: { name: "Ada" } }, { user: { name: "Grace" } });
+// [{ op: "replace", path: "/user/name", value: "Grace" }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
